The following are derivative works of that package, written against its
published build and reproducing parts of its behaviour and structure:

   fixes/*/src/**       replacement and wrapper implementations
   features/*/src/**    replacement and wrapper implementations
   pins/**              assertions describing the published package

Each such file replaces, wraps or characterises a function of the original.
Where a wrapper is used, the original implementation is retained and called;
the modification is the surrounding behaviour, and every patch directory's
README states what was changed and why.

The published package itself is not redistributed here. It is installed from
npm as a dependency, patched in place, and the patched build is not published.

Everything else in this repository — the patcher in lib/, the runners in
test/, the reproductions, and the documents — is original work under the
same licence.
